`charge under s 384` with `Sarjit Singh Rapati, no dishonest inducement` 's `refusal` is equal to A charge under section 384 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of extortion (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: dishonestly (section 24).
