`charge under s 384` with `Sarjit Singh Rapati, nothing delivered` 's `refusal` is equal to A charge under section 384 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of extortion (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: thereby induces the person so put in fear; to deliver any property or valuable security, or anything signed or sealed which may be converted into a valuable security.
